Deployment For The Template
===========================
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group fortune_smart_institue \
  --template-file appservice.json

Deployment For Websites
=============================
az webapp up \
  --resource-group fortune_smart_institue \
  --name fortune-smart-institute-app \
  --location westeurope \
  --html
====================================================
https://fortune-smart-institute-app.azurewebsites.net
=====================================================


Slot Swap Command Deployment
==============================
az webapp deployment slot swap \
  --resource-group fortune_smart_institue \
  --name fortune-smart-institute-app \
  --slot staging \
  --target-slot production
